
precompilation:
---------------

administration   1:   LEX: «Administration».

administration   3:   The "«Manager»" is a person.
administration   4:   The "«Secretary»" is a person.

administration   6:   The «Manager» appoints the «Secretary».


administration   9:   CLAUSE: «New Secretary».
administration  10:   The «Manager» may appoint a new «Secretary».

administration  12:   CLAUSE: «New Manager».
administration  13:   The «Manager» may appoint a new «Manager».


administration  16:   TERMS PER «Member»:

administration  18:   "«Member»" is a person.
administration  19:   "«Proposal»" is a text.

administration  21:   The «Secretary» may appoint a new «Member».

administration  23:   CLAUSE: «Notify».
administration  24:   The «Member» may send a «Proposal» to the «Manager».

administration  26:   CLAUSE: «Acknowledge».
administration  27:   The «Secretary» may notify the «Member» of "‹Acknowledgement of the Proposal›".

